WEBVTT

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:04.980
Seaside Branch

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:15.950
Heads down!

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.710
I win!

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:37.890
It's her 183rd consecutive win.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.930
Okay, who wants to play beach flag?

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.600
Is there really no one capable of beating Kyouno?

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.600
The rules are simple.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.770
You lost too, Izo.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.350
Hey, you and you there! Wanna try?

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:45.980
Okay, who's next?

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:47.480
Shut up!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.360
Here doggie, doggie!

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.770
Shake hands! C'mon, shake hands!

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:52.400
Shut up, I'm a wolf!

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:57.320
Hey Izo, be nice to the children.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.450
How childish...

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.250
Lan!

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.460
You got told!

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.460
Are you all right?

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:10.960
Woof woof!

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:12.210
You brats!

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:16.050
Huh? What happened to your haunted house?

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.470
Can't you tell?

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:21.060
No one is coming.

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.270
Really? I wonder why.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.940
Because you're stealing all the customers!

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.650
Huh? How so?

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.280
Forget it already.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.650
We worked so hard on it, too.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:39.700
What a waste.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.490
Okay, next up...

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:45.370
Get ready, guys!

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:48.710
Time for watermelon splitting!

