00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:28.350
The Kamogawa Experiment

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.350
Here's what we got from Laffinty after granting her asylum.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:32.060
Le Garite's data on the Vox Particle Control Experiment they conducted on Laffinty and Lympha?

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:36.570
Apparently, the results weren't too promising.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.400
It's as we suspected.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.570
Dizelmine plans to use the power of Vox...

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:49.410
He believes that complete control over the Voxes

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:53.330
will grant him the power to destroy entire planets.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.340
Militia Zodia...

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.670
It's no wonder Villagiulio can't stand by quietly.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:04.640
And neither will we.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:13.520
Madoka...

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.150
Here, first come, first serve!

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:18.980
I'll have this one!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.030
How about you, Lan?

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.740
Give me one too!

