Whoa, what happened?!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.700
Don't even ask!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.080
We told you, the customers aren't coming.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.250
Really? How strange.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.500
Haunted houses are usually pretty popular.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:39.710
Weird.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.960
Maybe it's too stifling?

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.050
It's too hot in that shack!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:47.840
There's no AC. It feels like a sauna in there.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:50.970
That's where ghosts are supposed to come in and send a chill down your spine.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.020
But we're not ghosts...

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.360
Can you just give us a break?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.560
That's the spirit!

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:11.080
<i>The Intergalactic Conference will take place here in Kamogawa in one week's time.</i>

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:17.210
<i>Representatives from various planets have been arriving one after another.</i>

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.330
<i>As the host city, Kamogawa has planned several events</i>

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:23.300
<i>to help our guests better understand its culture and that of Japan</i>

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.800
<i>and preparations are well under way.</i>

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.390
Hey, you two!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.890
Do you think your brothers have already arrived?

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.980
I don't know.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.600
I haven't received any messages so...

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.730
Um...

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.150
Oh, that's right!

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:48.410
Before the conference, Asteria plans to have a... uh... what did she call it, "three-way meeting"?{might want to to split this}

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.990
Sounds like something a school guidance counselor would do.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.580
Hey, maybe she's planning to do the same thing?

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.160
Anyway, that's what she's doing!

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.910
Right?

00:05:59.040 --> 00:05:59.880
Uh-huh...

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.050
Am I saying all the wrong things?

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:06.510
But, but...

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:13.390
I don't know quite how to put it...

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:18.730
But if your brothers talk it out just as you two did the other day...

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:21.100
I'm sure they'll be able to work it out.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:31.320
Anyway, if there's anything that I can do to help you two, I'll do it. Anything!

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.490
Thank you, Madoka.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.370
Sure!

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:48.050
Your Majesty, what about the situation with Lady Lan?

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.340
Let her be, for now.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:51.890
By the way...

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:52.470
Yes?

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.140
What is De Metrio up to?

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.810
Ever since Villagiulio went public about the existence of Ignis,

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:03.270
some in the Polyhedron have begun to show support for his cause.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.770
To think someone would actually side with that man...

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:11.570
They are only going to regret the foolish choice they've made, later on.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:16.950
They can beg for their lives, but I will show no mercy.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.330
Huh? An experiment?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.540
That's right.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.500
You don't mean...?

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.460
Yes.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.710
The Vox Particle Control Experiment.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.050
Oh...

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.930
Madoka, do you even understand?

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.930
That experiment delves deep into the test subject's psyche.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:41.230
Depending on the circumstances, it may cause severe damage to their subconscious.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.770
It's extremely dangerous.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:54.410
That time, the experiment was halted before it reached its final stage.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:59.410
That's probably what saved me back then.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:05.580
If the experiment had been completed, I probably wouldn't be here right now.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:06.630
Lan...

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.340
Ms. Chairman, why would you put Madoka through this experiment?

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.130
Huh?

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:16.510
You must feel bored just sitting there.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:17.800
Take one.

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:18.810
Huh?

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:20.060
I said, take one.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.020
This is the one I want to show you.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.780
What does that look like?

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.700
Well... A chalice?

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.070
Two people facing each other?

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:40.080
You're both right.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.830
Oh!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.790
It's all in the eyes of the beholder.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.370
It depends on your point of view.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.500
The Vox is considered a military weapon.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:53.970
But I believe its power could be used for something different.

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.630
Something different?

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:59.100
Yes. This may sound ludicrous, but we might be able to use

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:03.520
that immeasurable energy for non-belligerent purposes.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:07.310
If we can demonstrate that at the Intergalactic Conference,

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:13.440
Dizelmine and Villagiulio would be prevented from using the Vox as a weapon. Don't you think?{unbeatable anime logic}

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.280
All right, I'll do it!

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:17.740
Madoka...

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:20.910
This is a really difficult experiment. You understand that?

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:21.830
Uh-huh.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:26.370
But if there's a way to use Midori other than as a robot, I want to know.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.040
So I'll do it!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:30.420
Madoka, I appreciate your enthusiasm, but...

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.800
Don't worry, leave it to me!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.130
Didn't I just tell you?

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:38.800
If there's anything I can do to help you two, I'll do it!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.930
Madoka...

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:42.430
Madoka!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.390
If you're going for it, make sure you get results!

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:45.100
Okay!

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.440
Now that it's decided, let's not waste any time!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:01.370
If any of the sensors on your body come off, we'll have to re-attach them.

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:01.990
Double checking the stability and procedures of the experiment.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:01.990
So please endure it for a while.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.370
Deployment complete.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.370
Progress rate at 90%.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.790
We have completed notification to all control stations.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:07.460
Please hurry and complete final checks.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.620
Switching from pattern A to C.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:07.460
A as in "apple".

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.330
Sensors activated.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.460
Checking measuring instruments.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.460
Progress rate at 97%.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.380
L as in letter. B as in bow and arrow.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.380
R as in radio.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.710
Roger. Connecting now.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:21.430
If things go the way Asteria hopes, Madoka won't have to get mixed up in war.

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.010
Right?

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.850
Yes, that's why...

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.140
You support this?

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.350
I feel the same way.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:35.900
Progress rate at 99%.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:36.650
All systems go.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:37.490
All systems go.

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:38.320
All systems go.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.610
We're ready.

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.660
Good...

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.410
Madoka, are you ready?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:43.910
<i>Yes.</i>

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.040
Here I go!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:08.390
Craft has reached an altitude of 50,000 meters.

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:10.730
Aura is switching to stable mode.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:11.650
Everything's going well.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:16.320
We can link the Bio-Telepathic Control Wave of the pilot to Aura anytime.{Rink up}

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.280
Madoka!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:18.860
<i>Yes?</i>

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:22.110
<i>Just relax and take it in stride.</i>

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:22.740
Got it!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:36.540
Now guiding her consciousness to sub-conscious level.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:44.390
Applying hypnotherapy to stress her consciousness.

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.520
She's not responding to it.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:59.110
She's either dense or really tough.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:03.240
Normally, I'd praise her, but in this case...

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.780
It's not helping the experiment.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.200
Increasing stress levels.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:19.340
We've penetrated quite deep into her subconscious, but...

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:25.760
Any further and we may damage the CIB and and scar her psyche forever.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.600
Let's stop here, for now.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:36.650
Huh? Huh? Huh?!

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.900
<i>Hey, what's happening?</i>

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:42.360
<i>I don't feel a thing.</i>

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.490
Can you wait a minute?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.110
<i>Excuse—</i>

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:56.750
Vox Particles appear during times of intense anger, sadness, or hatred.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.290
At least they're supposed to.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:02.670
Could she be immune to artificial stimulation of the mind?

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:08.180
She always seems to be exceeding expectations, doesn't she?

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:10.560
She's impossible to predict.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:12.680
Enough!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.730
That's enough!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.640
Are we still going to continue?

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:22.860
Umm...

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.330
Ms. Chairman?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.920
Resume transmission.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:39.880
R-Right!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:44.670
<i>Umm, did you get any results?</i>

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:45.880
Kyouno Madoka.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:46.630
<i>Yes?</i>

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.390
You're a virgin, aren't you?

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:57.230
<i>Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wha—?</i>

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:00.230
What kind of question is that?!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:03.440
<i>Seems I guessed correctly.</i>

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.780
What a waste, when you have such a beautiful body.

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:10.160
Asteria?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.950
Who needs men when you three have each other, eh?

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:17.790
<i>What does that have to do with this experiment?!</i>

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:18.710
A lot.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:19.750
<i>What?!</i>

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:26.090
Next to anger, sadness, and hate, the next most powerful emotion

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.470
is shame.

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.050
Besides...

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.890
This way, she won't have to worry about any lasting trauma from the experiment.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.430
Probably not.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.890
Madoka...

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:39.350
I bet that body of yours is frustrated at times.{Are you frustrated?}

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.730
<i>Frustrated?</i>

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.310
<i>Just what do you mean by that?</i>

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:44.570
<i>For example...</i>

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.920
Her telepathic control waves are rising!{wtf did I just watch}

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:09.380
What?!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:13.180
Vox Particle Density at 300, 400,

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:14.180
Oh boy...

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.180
450...

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.100
It's over 500!

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.100
That worked nicely.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.310
<i>That's not fair!</i>

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:21.140
That's not fair!

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:24.810
Hey, Asteria!

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:27.690
Do you know how embarrassed I am right now?

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.650
<i>So what if Lan and Muginami are the only ones I've ever kissed?!</i>{canon pure maiden}

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:32.910
<i>What's wrong with that, huh?!</i>

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:32.910
Madoka...

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.200
I can't take it anymore!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:40.160
Vox Particle Density at 1200... 1600...

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.660
It's accelerating rapidly!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:45.750
That girl has quite the dirty mind.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:49.670
I wonder what she's imagining right now.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:53.340
R-rated stuff for sure! No minors allowed!

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.230
Decrease the stress level.

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:01.600
Right!

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.190
Level decreased.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.610
Density at 1800.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.320
Le Garite and De Metrio are contacting us.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:15.200
Both sides trying to reach us at this particular moment, huh?

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.830
Are they competing to see who gets permission first?

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:22.250
I must say, they fight over the most trivial things.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.080
Give the go-ahead.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:24.790
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.170
Shouldn't we stop the experiment?

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.670
You're right.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.590
I suppose we have no choice.

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:33.010
Get Madoka and Aura to return immediately.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:33.550
Roger.

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:49.860
The Vox Particle density is continuing to rise.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.940
It will hit 2500 shortly!

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:52.360
What?

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:56.110
These are the same numbers when the last Rin-ne opened up.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.120
Get me an outside view!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.290
What is that?!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.430
That red thing... What is it?

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.140
It's like blood spewing out.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.560
Madoka!

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.690
Militia Zodia...

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.990
Vox Aura... Kyouno Madoka!

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.620
Vox Particle density at the observation point is still rising!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.070
Please respond!

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:40.620
Vox Aura!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.830
Please respond!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.540
We are switching from Green to Red!

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.830
Kyouno Madoka, respond!

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.450
Repeat, Red!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.040
Switch from Pattern C to F complete!

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.870
Please respond!

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:48.080
Pharos will enter emergency mode.

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:46.960
The Rin-ne...

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.080
Please respond!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:18.490
Yeah... I suppose that's true.

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:19.990
Maybe she's right.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:26.040
I mean, I'll be a mother some day too.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.540
Before that, I'll have to experience—

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:30.960
Madoka, you idiot! What are you thinking?!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:36.920
Huh? When did...? How?

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:42.550
Red inside green?

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:49.390
<i>Why? Why won't you understand?</i>

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:54.230
<i>Aura has exceeded escape velocity!</i>

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.150
What? What happened?

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.860
<i>We're disconnected from Aura!</i>

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.740
Huh? I can hear you!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.070
Hey, what's going on?!

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:01.820
Hey!

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:05.330
<i>Unidentified crafts have suddenly appeared and are surrounding Aura.</i>

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:06.120
<i>Who are they?!</i>

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:06.990
<i>It's unconfirmed!</i>

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:08.660
What?

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.920
<i>Get Aura back stat!</i>

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:13.630
<i>The auto-pilot isn't working!</i>

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.170
<i>Our transmission is being blocked.</i>

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:22.510
<i>Absolutely... unforgivable...</i>

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:28.180
<i>Unforgivable!</i>

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:32.940
I've... met you before...

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.110
<i>The fact is that you were chosen.</i>

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.480
<i>It's all up to you.</i>

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:42.780
<i>Why repeat it all over again?!</i>

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.320
Huh?

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:46.030
<i>Do you intend to destroy the world?!</i>

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.080
Do not open the Rin-ne!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.870
I alone will suffice!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.210
Wh-Why...?

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:54.790
Remember!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:58.380
Just by being there, life is...

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.850
I don't understand this...

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:12.190
Close... Close!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.670
I have vital signs!

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:37.590
Thank goodness!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.090
What about the unidentified crafts?

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:40.500
They've been destroyed.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.010
Can we get through to Madoka?

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.720
Our communications are dead.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:49.060
What an ironic turn of events.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:52.060
We have demonstrated that the Vox's power is unprecedented.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.560
And it's now known not just to us,

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:57.150
but to many others as well.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:05.780
Is this the Aura's... no, Kyouno Madoka's power?

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:11.700
It's the power of the Vox, given only to those who have the Memoria.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:15.580
Now that you've seen it, what will you do...

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:19.380
Young King Dizelmine of Le Garite?

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:23.670
Found you, Lord Dizelmine!

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:26.470
Yes, you did.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.390
It's tea time!

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:34.890
Yurikano made you some very tasty herb tea.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:47.240
Tell me, Midori... what happened?

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:49.990
What happened...?

